   "sourceHash": "4a78a301bf16cd934555750e0de0f26a849081b6a8b3780f6677bed97a2b5ed0",
   "text": "Shikha Sen · Gurgaon · 由 Kanchan Vohra 发布于 Google",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5ed9dc2c33f0caacf1c4",
   "sourceHash": "5ed9dc2c33f0caacf1c46a8acda04bdc93028573357ea151de9b744012574626",
   "text": "“在实际需求与舒适之间取得了极好的平衡。优秀的医生帮助我了解了针对个人健康的整体阿育吠陀方法。2月仅经过一次为期 3 天的（入院评估）访问，我就对 Kairali 和为我量身制定的治疗方案充满信任，于是预订了为期 4 周的治疗。很期待4月再次回来。”",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'luxury' in review quote rendered as 舒适 (comfort) per register lock; confirm acceptable for a quoted review."
   ]
  },
