   "text": "寻得内心宁静",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ace3c50b018f2ff69825",
   "sourceHash": "ace3c50b018f2ff6982551b71a90872056f3473bb59cda7cd58c70bd17893829",
   "text": "探寻宁静，滋养心灵",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_55d5f9391acd212230ad",
   "sourceHash": "55d5f9391acd212230ade44180dcb04835668584f01212ee8e638d7daef7f5e3",
   "text": "自然的怡人居所",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_30714d99ddcad44228cb",
   "sourceHash": "30714d99ddcad44228cb4960193e32c4252550a58cec10f155f86bd1f89dd9b0",
   "text": "置身于郁郁葱葱的绿意、纯净的自然景观与具有疗愈作用的大自然之中，为内心平静与放松营造出理想的环境。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b1bcb576d8e829b38675",
   "sourceHash": "b1bcb576d8e829b38675d288fcfa146322287b6983db675c4c09c5a17b1a863f",
   "text": "焕活身、心、灵",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bebc754cb5a73e15b4f2",
   "sourceHash": "bebc754cb5a73e15b4f2e2d72f08cb166a11e18bd6aac90939e493d6d8a0cf4c",
   "text": "沉浸于焕活疗法、古老仪式与令人充满活力的瑜伽课程之中，这些都经过精心安排，旨在协调您的感官、增强活力，并促进整体健康。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9bc43956cd3c4fdc7baf",
   "sourceHash": "9bc43956cd3c4fdc7baf15b577afb56343861952980f2d5bf1a2562b6e61177c",
   "text": "本地种植，本地制作",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_63322c6b681d8b715849",
   "sourceHash": "63322c6b681d8b715849e83a090f15d72dad2587482b435493d0a3f86cc254d2",
   "text": "纯正阿育吠陀，自家种植的天然好物",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b7b5e5754412af239ef6",
   "sourceHash": "b7b5e5754412af239ef674d80f5415de30944d61d3fdc96b7d99fb54053c3912",
   "text": "通过我们从农场到餐桌的饮食和阿育吠陀产品，滋养身体、焕活心灵。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a1b3bacb2ac9b10e33f7",
   "sourceHash": "a1b3bacb2ac9b10e33f77f52a33af5fc5595cda69e766ca7e370df9da745c990",
   "text": "品尝本院精心烹制的从农场到餐桌的美食，旨在净化身体、焕发精神。体验我们 100% 阿育吠陀自产产品的焕新力量，这些产品以卓越的功效和天然品质著称。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'wellness retreat' rendered as 本院 (our hospital); 'Indulge' softened. Source claim 'unmatched efficacy' translated faithfully as 卓越的功效 — an efficacy claim that may need Dr. Deepu John review."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bfb20166b0d93b0cc8cc",
   "sourceHash": "bfb20166b0d93b0cc8cc0b65e59bb6732306d49fa5ca5ecdd416b38d88fc2ea9",
   "text": "从农场到餐桌的美好",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2aab68dbac7d3e7d993d",
   "sourceHash": "2aab68dbac7d3e7d993db90ee2b3a6480666e9c11a34bbccba7d71b66b42cb86",
   "text": "品味当地采购的有机食材，经用心烹制，为您的身体提供充分的营养。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4fae643be45859194f06",
   "sourceHash": "4fae643be45859194f06474687a3756bdfb3d5d6edb1a826f41a993905bb985d",
   "text": "卓越阿育吠陀",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c06dbca74573a86ac036",
   "sourceHash": "c06dbca74573a86ac0366a7bca9f05a78329fb0d3702cf0f7a24069658c8db9a",
   "text": "借助我们的自产产品系列，领略阿育吠陀的古老智慧。这些产品经过精心配制，旨在促进整体健康与内在和谐。",
